# Environment
# .env holds ONLY public/non-secret values (OAuth client ids, etc.) and is
# intentionally committed — see .env.example and 간편로그인-수정금지-지침.md.
# Real secrets belong in .env.local, which stays gitignored.
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

